  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"><strong>Overview<strong></strong></strong></h3>\nThe following 3D printed models require a Split Ring Keychain. Purchase the keychains and customize your 3D model to your liking. Visit <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/zh/makerlab\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>Maker Lab</strong></span></a> Images to Keychains.\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\" style=\"display: flex;\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"Socket Head Cap Machine Screws (SHCS)\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/97e21dcff89c4940aeea33d960689dba/888.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"Socket Head Cap Machine Screws (SHCS)\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/97e21dcff89c4940aeea33d960689dba/888.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_mi\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px;\">Document